  "bio": "SLOWLY SLOWLY ARE A MELBOURNE INDIE-ROCK BAND LED BY SINGER, GUITARIST AND SONGWRITER BEN STEWART, KNOWN FOR BIG MELODIES, SHARP LYRICS AND AN EMOTIONAL, ANTHEMIC SOUND BUILT FOR THE LIVE STAGE. BLENDING INDIE ROCK, PUNK ENERGY AND CLASSIC SONGWRITING INFLUENCES, THE BAND HAS GROWN INTO ONE OF AUSTRALIA’S MOST DISTINCTIVE MODERN ROCK ACTS, WITH TOP-10 ALBUMS, A DEVOTED FOLLOWING AND SONGS THAT TACKLE LOVE, LOSS, FORGIVENESS AND PERSONAL GROWTH WITH BOTH RAWNESS AND HUGE SINGALONG CHORUSES.",
